# =============================================================================
# LDIF Test Data — AcmeCorp (~5000 users)
# Generated for LDAPPortal testing
# Base DN: dc=acmecorp,dc=com
#
# Note: the suffix root entry (dc=acmecorp,dc=com) is intentionally NOT
# included here. osixia/openldap auto-creates it from LDAP_DOMAIN at
# container init. Defining it again would make ldapadd return code 68
# (Already exists) and abort the bootstrap, leaving the directory empty
# except for the auto-created suffix + admin entry.
# =============================================================================

